-    *   Vertex indices.
-    *   Face normal vector.
-    *   Visibility status (view-dependent).
-*   **Visible Face List:** A subset of the exterior face list containing only faces visible from the current eye position.
-*   **Screen Polygons:** Convex polygons in screen coordinates resulting from the orthographic projection of visible exterior faces.
